- # package-tracker
- Track package deliveries from major carriers (UPS, FedEx, DHL, USPS, Royal Mail, China Post, and more). Query tracking status and estimated delivery dates.
- ## Features
- - Support for 100+ carriers worldwide
- - Get latest tracking status and location
- - Estimated delivery date
- - Delivery history / timeline
- - Check multiple packages at once
- ## Usage
- track 1Z999AA10123456784
- track TRACK123456789
- track --carrier fedex 123456789012
- track --multi "1Z999AA1,TRACK456"
- ## Parameters
- - `tracking_number`: The package tracking number
- - `carrier`: (optional) Force specific carrier
- - `multi`: (optional) Comma-separated list of tracking numbers
